- Removed the deprecated `/api/v1/fleet/mdm/...` aliases of endpoints that moved out of `/mdm`, such as `/mdm/commands`, `/mdm/profiles`, `/mdm/bootstrap`, and `/mdm/setup/eula`, and the deprecated `/mdm/apple/profiles`, `/mdm/apple/commands`, `/mdm/apple/filevault/summary`, `PATCH /mdm/apple/settings`, `POST /mdm/apple/request_csr`, `POST /mdm/apple/dep/key_pair`, and `POST /mdm/apple/enqueue` endpoints. They now return 410.
- Fleet now sends hosts the bootstrap package URL `/api/latest/fleet/bootstrap?token=` during enrolment. `GET /api/latest/fleet/mdm/bootstrap?token=` still works for hosts that were sent the old URL.
